perdue.definition:
a. Lost to view; in concealment or ambush; close.
a. Accustomed to, or employed in, desperate enterprises;
   hence, reckless; hopeless.

perversion.definition:
n. a curve that reverses the direction of something
n. an aberrant sexual practice; 
n. the action of perverting something (turning it to a wrong use)

